Material adaptations in this template include:

- a committed local-Markdown tracker instead of an ephemeral scratch tracker;
- explicit decision criteria, outcome branches, evidence links, and blockers;
- execution-aware rules for bounded mathematical computation;
- numbered experiment notes and reproducibility/provenance requirements; and
- a read-only dual-model adversarial-review gate for strategic Wayfinder
  selection, redirection, closure, and frontier promotion.

The cup--cap recurrence in `ErdosSzekeres/CupCap.lean` adapts the proof
structure of Jineon Baek's `jcpaik/erdos-tuza-valtr` Lean formalization:

  https://github.com/jcpaik/erdos-tuza-valtr
  commit a5ad53efefb36f8654b9227ce4dba2bf04a7ec3f

